  "title": "In my opinion",
  "goal": "Name languages, give opinions and say how with -CA (Almanca, bence, yavaşça), and say how many each with -(ş)Ar (birer, ikişer).",
  "points": ["gp-ca", "gp-distributive"],
  "intro": {
    "text": "`-CA` makes languages (*Almanca*, *Rusça*), opinions (*bence*, in my opinion; *Sence?*, what do you think?) and adverbs (*yavaşça*, gently). On a number, `-(ş)Ar` means **each**: *birer* (one each), *ikişer* (two each).",
    "see": "gp-ca"
  },
